### Get all movies (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### Get one existing movie (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Get a missing movie (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/999

### Create a valid movie (Expected: 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "director": "Denis Villeneuve",
  "year": 2016,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### Create an invalid movie (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "not a number"
}

### Replace a movie with PUT (Expected: 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix",
  "director": "The Wachowskis",
  "year": 1999,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### PUT with a missing property (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix"
}

### Partially update a movie (Expected: 200 OK)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2000
}

### Filter and sort movies (Expected: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi&minYear=2000&sort=year

### Use an invalid minYear (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=invalid

### Delete an existing movie (Expected: 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Delete the same movie again (Expected: 404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Request an unknown route (Expected: 404 Route Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/does-not-exist